    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "03 / PRIVATE LOG INVESTIGATION",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 30,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "In the platform terminal, inspect `journalctl --user -u ambicrafted-console.service --since '30 min ago' -o cat`. Match the exact `trace_id` from Tempo to a structured API event. Keep raw logs private; do not paste them into external tools. Transport/delivery status does not establish reasoning quality. No external alert recipient is configured."
      }
